# Ignore file for Dockerfile.errow (BuildKit picks up <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile).
# The build context is the upstream Errow tree; ship only what the image build reads.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE.md
!scripts/tui_sidecar_hook.py
!errow
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
errow/interface/viewer/frontend/node_modules
